  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of the Chapels and Narthex of the Early 12th-Century Church of the Virgin at Gelati Monastery in Kutaisi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gelati Monastery is one of the most important cultural achievements of a unified medieval Georgian state. This project, which continues work carried out under previous Ambassasdors Fund grants, involves the conservation of stone masonry walls of the chapels and narthex of the Church of the Virgin at the monastery.</narrative>
  </description>
